5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know why the car is never ready when I need it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,The arranging takes longer than the driving. I want to see the time cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We assume shares are equal. I need to know what an even split really means.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,The silence between us is getting loud. I want to know what breaks groups.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,We are guessing at the money. I need the real figures for the year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, is the arranging really that bad? I just want a clean start.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, it is. But I need to prove it with hours, not feelings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
