13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, maybe. But I am worried about the mood, not just the math.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, the receipts will show the fuel. That is a start.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the handover state. It is the most annoying part.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the diary hours. I need to see the weekly pattern.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the tax papers. Fixed costs are the baseline.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will ask the other households. They have been through this.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will get the fuel receipts. That is the biggest variable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Let's see what the data says before we argue more.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"Yes. Facts first, then we decide.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,A wise approach. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Okay. I hope it helps us talk again.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's do it. I want to stop guessing.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
