35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often dirty and low on fuel. The weekly trips keep failing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple the use of Tuesdays. Recording takes an hour a week.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Fixed costs are 280,000 yen. But two people bought most of the fuel.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Other groups failed because they had to ask favours. Checking figures caused fights.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The fuel receipts match Servas. Two people did most of the driving.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, if Saturdays are so heavy, how do we handle that?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, that is the problem. Fixed days might not work if use is uneven.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, so a simple split is unfair. We need to account for usage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, but if we check figures, we might fight like the other groups.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, we can agree on a method first, then trust it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I worry about the state of the car. Who is responsible for cleaning?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, maybe the person who uses it last cleans it?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,That is a rule. But who pays for the wear and tear?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,We need a system that doesn't require constant asking.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"A booking system might work. You book, you pay for the distance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,A booking system sounds fair. But will people actually use it?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"If it is simple, yes. I hate the current mess.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,It requires discipline. But it is the most equitable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,It removes the favour-asking. That is good for the mood.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree. Let's look at the options.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
